    "title": "'I shot him': Man charged with murder after fatal shooting in York City: police - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By CBS 21 News ,\n7 hours ago YORK COUNTY, Pa. (WHP) — A York County man is facing criminal homicide charges after police say he shot and killed a man at close range, according to York City Police. Jordan Frey, 20, has been charged with criminal homicide and unlicensed possession of a firearm after a fatal shooting Wednesday morning. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 6",
